   },
   {
    "claim": "Advertisers can upload lists of email addresses and phone numbers (also hashed versions and device advertising IDs); OpenAI checks which match ChatGPT users",
    "sources": [
     0,
     1,
     2,
     3
    ]
   },
   {
    "claim": "Per OpenAI, list-based audiences need about 25,000 matches (Gadget Review: at least 25,000 matched users; Gizmodo: 25,000 entries; MobileSyrup: more than 25,000)",
